OL,3,AThieves who stole four Renoir paintings
OL,4,Aabandoned two in garden as they fled,
OL,5,Asays mayor
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pair of thieves who stole four Renoir
OL,8,Fpaintings from a French museum left two
OL,9,Fin the garden as they fled, the local
OL,10,Fmayor says
OL,12,FAuthorities initially thought only one
OL,13,Fof the paintings had been abandoned
OL,15,FOne French outlet says the four stolen
OL,16,Fpaintings are: Portrait of Madame
OL,17,FPichon (1895); Portrait of Madame
OL,18,FColonna Romano (1910); Coco Lisant
OL,19,F(1905); and Jeune fille au puits (1886)
OL,20,F- it's not known which two were
OL,21,Fabandoned
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
